_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md-398-2. **Full preset mapping** — every account has its complete style rotation documented
_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md-399-3. **Posting schedules with time slots** — not just "3x/day" but when and why
_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md-400-4. **Content pillars per account** — structured rotation prevents topic repetition
_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md-401-5. **Reddit account needs 3 new presets** — 1 preset won't sustain a high-volume account
_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md:402:6. **Cross-promotion rules** — when, how, and between which accounts (with isolation protocol)
_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md-403-7. **Quality gates before posting** — 5-point checklist prevents bad content going live
_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md-404-8. **Kill criteria** — clear metrics to pivot or drop underperforming accounts at 30 days
_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md-405-9. **A/B testing calendar** — structured experimentation instead of random changes
_dev\tiktok-6-account-strategy.md-406-10. **Monetization timeline** — phased from growth-only to Creator Fund to multi-platform
