_dev\loop-engineering\phases-plans\contracts.md:183:As specified in [proposition-final.md](proposition-final.md) §Persistence — `schema_version: 1`, nodes `{id, type, type_version, name, position, configuration, disabled}`, edges `{id, source_node, source_port, target_node, target_port, edge_type}`, reserved `variables: {}`, `viewport`, `settings: {on_error}`, ISO timestamps. Persisted under `output/workflows/{workflow_id}.json` via `safe_json_write`; soft-delete to `output/TRASH/workflows/`. `output/workflows/` and `output/branding/` must be added to clear-all handling.
